
>> shop := (Galmee-jechootaa haaraa
	kaaʼi: ['magazine'] itti: ['books'],
	kaaʼi: ['computer'] itti: ['electronics'],
	kaaʼi: ['lipstick'] itti: ['cosmetics']
).
Baʼii barreessi: (shop qaba: ['computer']), dhaabi. 
Baʼii barreessi: (shop qaba: ['sausage']), dhaabi. 
Baʼii barreessi: (shop qaba: ['computers']), dhaabi. 
Baʼii barreessi: (shop qaba: ['compute']), dhaabi. 
Baʼii barreessi: (shop qaba: ['2computer']), dhaabi. 
